	 * Searches for customization files (`CLAUDE.md`, `.claude/CLAUDE.md`,
	 * `.github/copilot-instructions.md` and `AGENTS.md`) in the parent directories above the
	 * workspace root folder(s).
	 *
	 * This is useful when the workspace folder is nested inside a parent repository. Only searches
